            "vd_help_notes_title|Good to know",
            "vd_help_note_uac|Windows asks for administrator consent each time a disk is mounted or unmounted, and for a partition disk also each time FileDO reads it; Image to file makes a .fdd copy that needs none. A password is asked for once per operation and forgotten when it ends.",
