            "vd_auto_note_uninstall|Both scheduled tasks stay after an uninstall of FileDO. The logon switch and the guard switch here are what remove them.",
            "vd_help_note_autostart|Autostart - the logon mounts and the shutdown guard - is in one dialog: Autostart.. under More actions, in a disk's menu or in its detail pane.",
